WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:14,420
Is it safe to do your parasite program with kids? I know digestive enzymes and

00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:18,000
SBI. Protector okay for them but what about proverma

00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,840
feuds or the paratocin or the pylora cell. All of those are safe with kids. You

00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:30,040
just have to dose them based upon their weight. So let's say you know it says the

00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:33,760
adult dose it just pretend three times a day on something. So if you figure the

00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:39,100
adult is about 150 pounds. If you have a child that's 50 pounds you only want to

00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:45,640
give them one a day. So just dose it down for their size. Those are fine with

00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,100
kids. Oh of course it depends on what age kid. If you got a two-year-old that

00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:55,100
wouldn't do that at all. But if you have like five six seven eight-year-old certainly

00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:57,100
you could do that.

